      "optimizationResults": "### Bayesian Parameter Optimization Results\n\nAnalysis completed for response **Yield**\n\n| Parameter | Setting |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Optimization Goal** | **Maximize Response** |\n| **Search Domain** | **Extended by ±30% (Steepest Ascent Enabled)** |\n| **Current Best Observed** | **98.80 %** (Historical Mean: 83.12) |\n\n#### Surrogate Model Architecture\n**Trend-Aware Gaussian Process (Universal Kriging / Matern 5/2)**\n- **Response Surface Trend:** Linear drift fitted (R² = 80.7%). Projects positive/negative trajectories outside the tested box.\n- **GP Hyperparameters:** Length-scale *l* = 2.00, noise *σ_n* = 0.100.\n- **Extrapolation Behavior:** Predicts along the path of steepest ascent/descent while expanding uncertainty intervals with distance.\n\n#### Method of Steepest Ascent (Extrapolation Direction)\nTo drive **Yield** beyond the current observed maximum, the response surface gradient indicates the following factor stepping directions:\n\n- **Temperature:** **Increase (+)** (Sensitivity: 13.43)\n- **Catalyst Loading:** **Increase (+)** (Sensitivity: 10.11)\n- **Reaction Time:** **Increase (+)** (Sensitivity: 6.64)\n\n#### Recommended Next Runs\nThe optimizer suggests the following conditions balancing exploration (learning uncertain regions) and exploitation (maximizing performance) using **Expected Improvement (EI)**:\n\n**Suggestion #1** 🚀 *(Extrapolated +45% beyond previous bounds)*\n- **Predicted Yield:** **~106.27 %** (95% Confidence Interval: [103.72, 108.82])\n- **Factor Settings:**\n  - Temperature: **106.14 °C** *(+45% above tested max of 95)*\n  - Catalyst Loading: **3.17 mol%** *(+34% above tested max of 2.5)*\n  - Reaction Time: **6.88 h** *(+22% above tested max of 6)*\n  - Solvent (Categorical): **2-MeTHF**\n\n**Suggestion #2** 🚀 *(Extrapolated +27% beyond previous bounds)*\n- **Predicted Yield:** **~104.51 %** (95% Confidence Interval: [102.63, 106.39])\n- **Factor Settings:**\n  - Temperature: **99.66 °C** *(+19% above tested max of 95)*\n  - Catalyst Loading: **2.96 mol%** *(+23% above tested max of 2.5)*\n  - Reaction Time: **7.09 h** *(+27% above tested max of 6)*\n  - Solvent (Categorical): **Toluene**\n\n**Suggestion #3** 🚀 *(Extrapolated +23% beyond previous bounds)*\n- **Predicted Yield:** **~102.24 %** (95% Confidence Interval: [100.70, 103.77])\n- **Factor Settings:**\n  - Temperature: **100.83 °C** *(+23% above tested max of 95)*\n  - Catalyst Loading: **2.24 mol%**\n  - Reaction Time: **6.88 h** *(+22% above tested max of 6)*\n  - Solvent (Categorical): **Toluene**\n\n> **Laboratory Execution Tip:** When exploring conditions outside previously tested bounds (e.g. higher temperatures or catalyst charges), verify chemical compatibility and run confirmatory trials to validate that no unexpected side reactions or thermal degradation occur at the extrapolated settings.\n",
